<title>USA: U.S. June S&amp;P 500 futures turn negative.</title>
<headline>U.S. June S&amp;P 500 futures turn negative.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 17 - U.S. June S&amp;P 500 futures turned lower in brisk afternoon trade, sliding after Treasury bond futures closed. June failed to reach 774.60--last week's high--leading to some technical disappointment, traders said. Nasdaq 225 futures firm but off from highs. June S&amp;P back into Wednesday's trading range.</p>
